      ],
      "note": "temp_c = -273 makes calcCO2corr's 273 + temp zero, so the portal displays Inf for the correction (calculation_functions.R:530). The wrapper emits it; Inf serialises to JSON null under na=null and the API drops nulls, so it reaches the caller as an absent key. Field_BP_altitude is 0 because bigleaf::pressure.from.elevation at 0.15 K rounds to zero, which the portal writes as 0."
